(1870905, 258029, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesing and clever idea, if her outfit only matched the sky a little better so it really looked like she was lost in the sky and all you could see was her hands and head.  The light on her skirt and shirt seem off for some reason, was it a flash from the camera?  Or are we reaching for something in the clouds?  Is there a specific shape there?  A 5</td>', 'Interesing and clever idea, if her outfit only matched the sky a little better so it really looked like she was lost in the sky and all you could see was her hands and head.  The light on her skirt and shirt seem off for some reason, was it a flash from the camera?  Or are we reaching for something in the clouds?  Is there a specific shape there?  A 5', '2005-11-16 00:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
