(1870966, 258251, 39057, '<td valign="top">So far I''ve seen two of these leaf butterflys....both good.</td>', 'So far I''ve seen two of these leaf butterflys....both good.', '2005-11-16 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1870979, 256254, 12448, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''ve been back and forth all over this picture and I have NO IDEA who is saying the title.  I see no squirrel or bird, maybe that is your evil plan to get people to sit and stare at your picture all night, BWHAHAHAHA! :)  Just kiddin, with the exception of not being able to find what is doing the talking it''s an interesting shot.  The DOF is the most interesting part, the front being totally out of focus in the shade while the sunny branches are nice and clear.  A 6</td>', 'Okay, I''ve been back and forth all over this picture and I have NO IDEA who is saying the title.  I see no squirrel or bird, maybe that is your evil plan to get people to sit and stare at your picture all night, BWHAHAHAHA! :)  Just kiddin, with the exception of not being able to find what is doing the talking it''s an interesting shot.  The DOF is the most interesting part, the front being totally out of focus in the shade while the sunny branches are nice and clear.  A 6', '2005-11-16 00:34:04.000000', NULL, 1),
