(1871000, 258259, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hello?  Is this you or did you force this very nice lady to pose for you? :)  Well done, I like the colors on this, the use of the camouflage itself and the branches and trees aregood also.  I think I would have liked the shades to stay on or have just the glasses on and ONLY the eyes showing, would have really made this over the top for me.  As is, an 8</td>', 'Hello?  Is this you or did you force this very nice lady to pose for you? :)  Well done, I like the colors on this, the use of the camouflage itself and the branches and trees aregood also.  I think I would have liked the shades to stay on or have just the glasses on and ONLY the eyes showing, would have really made this over the top for me.  As is, an 8', '2005-11-16 00:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871001, 257349, 47117, '<td valign="top">Fugly Ugly!  Kind of camo''s in though, so the score I give will reflect that, and the subject :)</td>', 'Fugly Ugly!  Kind of camo''s in though, so the score I give will reflect that, and the subject :)', '2005-11-16 00:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
