(1871006, 257859, 47117, '<td valign="top">Uhhh, don''t think so.  If it was just the tree, maybe, but a bright yellow car? I do like the snow though. I haven''t seen any real snow in a while :(</td>', 'Uhhh, don''t think so.  If it was just the tree, maybe, but a bright yellow car? I do like the snow though. I haven''t seen any real snow in a while :(', '2005-11-16 00:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871014, 258004, 12448, '<td valign="top">You can''t catch me!  Sorry, that is the first thing that came to mind when I saw this.  My son does that all the time.  Well done over all, composition is well done, the branch leading you in, taking you to the first ant and then continuing on to the second ant.  A great find and nice capture overall.  The lack of sharpness is it''s biggest downfall overall, the lighting, the DOF and the shot itself is great.  Couldn''t have been easy getting this one.  An 8</td>', 'You can''t catch me!  Sorry, that is the first thing that came to mind when I saw this.  My son does that all the time.  Well done over all, composition is well done, the branch leading you in, taking you to the first ant and then continuing on to the second ant.  A great find and nice capture overall.  The lack of sharpness is it''s biggest downfall overall, the lighting, the DOF and the shot itself is great.  Couldn''t have been easy getting this one.  An 8', '2005-11-16 00:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
