(1871045, 256819, 39057, '<td valign="top">Like it!</td>', 'Like it!', '2005-11-16 00:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871047, 258105, 12448, '<td valign="top">Oooooooooooo, ick, ick, ick!!!!  I hate those spiders!  But on to the shot itself, just don''t make me hold the spider, kay?<br/> <br/>This is a great idea overall and the sharpness of the fibers in the carpet and the detail on the spider is outstanding.  The DOF is well done but the light seems a tad harsh and there seems to be a little spot on his back area that''s a tad blown out.  The orange colors in the carpet are a bit distracting.  Maybe if the whole thing was converted to Black and White and it would really make the spider a part of the scenery, forcing the viewer to spend more time looking for him.  But again, great capture, tell me you killed him afterwards!  LOL:)  A 7</td>', 'Oooooooooooo, ick, ick, ick!!!!  I hate those spiders!  But on to the shot itself, just don''t make me hold the spider, kay? This is a great idea overall and the sharpness of the fibers in the carpet and the detail on the spider is outstanding.  The DOF is well done but the light seems a tad harsh and there seems to be a little spot on his back area that''s a tad blown out.  The orange colors in the carpet are a bit distracting.  Maybe if the whole thing was converted to Black and White and it would really make the spider a part of the scenery, forcing the viewer to spend more time looking for him.  But again, great capture, tell me you killed him afterwards!  LOL:)  A 7', '2005-11-16 00:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871049, 258234, 45857, '<td valign="top">certainly a horse of a different color. I think having the point of her chin in frame is a weak element.</td>', 'certainly a horse of a different color. I think having the point of her chin in frame is a weak element.', '2005-11-16 00:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
