(1871070, 256354, 8455, '<td valign="top">the colours of this are beautiful.  I makes me think of something, but I haven''t figured out what yet... avocado green, almost retro, if a bird can look that way.<br/> <br/>My only nitpick would be that the leaf that shines in the background is the only really ''shiny'' part of the image, the rest is so smooth, and it takes a bit away from the overall texture. -9</td>', 'the colours of this are beautiful.  I makes me think of something, but I haven''t figured out what yet... avocado green, almost retro, if a bird can look that way. My only nitpick would be that the leaf that shines in the background is the only really ''shiny'' part of the image, the rest is so smooth, and it takes a bit away from the overall texture. -9', '2005-11-16 00:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871073, 257966, 47117, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot, but I just don''t get the camo. I know it must be the mountains, but it just lacks something for me visually.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot, but I just don''t get the camo. I know it must be the mountains, but it just lacks something for me visually.', '2005-11-16 00:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871074, 257349, 17507, '<td valign="top">One of a very few images of a genuine instance of camouflage. Very nice work.</td>', 'One of a very few images of a genuine instance of camouflage. Very nice work.', '2005-11-16 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871075, 255878, 39057, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2005-11-16 00:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871077, 256845, 47117, '<td valign="top">Does camo well!  Nice shot of the bird!</td>', 'Does camo well!  Nice shot of the bird!', '2005-11-16 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871078, 257785, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very cool and well done.  Did a double take on the shot there.  I love the concept and you almost pulled it off completely.  The edges around the face are a bit harsh and stand out, breaking the seam between the face and the wall.  Maybe if you had put a cloth around the edge or even some tape to blend it all together so there wasn''t as noticable a seam there.  The eyes looking off is nice but looking directly at the camera, making the the type of eyes that follow you around the room would have really added some impact for me personally.  And the glare on the forehead is the only other nitpicky thing I see.  But again, great concept, great composition an 8</td>', 'Very cool and well done.  Did a double take on the shot there.  I love the concept and you almost pulled it off completely.  The edges around the face are a bit harsh and stand out, breaking the seam between the face and the wall.  Maybe if you had put a cloth around the edge or even some tape to blend it all together so there wasn''t as noticable a seam there.  The eyes looking off is nice but looking directly at the camera, making the the type of eyes that follow you around the room would have really added some impact for me personally.  And the glare on the forehead is the only other nitpicky thing I see.  But again, great concept, great composition an 8', '2005-11-16 00:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1871081, 257640, 47117, '<td valign="top">Very cute dog and idea. Like it a lot!</td>', 'Very cute dog and idea. Like it a lot!', '2005-11-16 00:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
