(1871176, 258195, 12448, '<td valign="top">I see a bug, couldn''t tell you if it was a wasp or a moth, I do see the eggs though! :)<br/> <br/>An interesting shot overall but the post processing left some harsh lines around the edges  an the body of the insect looks, I''m not sure how to describe it, very compressed I would say.  Not very natural, almost like a plastic body with a regular head and wings.    The focus of the shot seems more on the leaf than the bug and maybe it was tried to correct during post editing, I have no idea.  But a nice capture overall,  nice composition.  A 5</td>', 'I see a bug, couldn''t tell you if it was a wasp or a moth, I do see the eggs though! :) An interesting shot overall but the post processing left some harsh lines around the edges  an the body of the insect looks, I''m not sure how to describe it, very compressed I would say.  Not very natural, almost like a plastic body with a regular head and wings.    The focus of the shot seems more on the leaf than the bug and maybe it was tried to correct during post editing, I have no idea.  But a nice capture overall,  nice composition.  A 5', '2005-11-16 00:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
