(1871222, 258230, 8455, '<td valign="top">This image is a great concept, I like the creativity in not choosing the typical ''camoflauge'' items.  However I think that the image would greatly improve if the sign and the ?dashboard top? were not in it; they are much clearer than anything else in the image and it''s distracting.</td>', 'This image is a great concept, I like the creativity in not choosing the typical ''camoflauge'' items.  However I think that the image would greatly improve if the sign and the ?dashboard top? were not in it; they are much clearer than anything else in the image and it''s distracting.', '2005-11-16 01:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
