(1871235, 257628, 12448, '<td valign="top">Where did she go?  I can see you!  Great idea and I bet you had a lot of fun shooting this one!  But then again her eyes look a little sleepy in there, hope she got a great reward for letting you bury her!  <br/> <br/>The idea is a great one, been done before no doubt but still a nice overall execution of the idea.  My biggest problem is the lack of focus through out the shot.  Maybe if you had used DOF to bring in the front and have her as a part of the background?  So you really had to search for her type thing.  The composition also leaves me wanting just a tad, the doll head in the lower right corner keeps competing for my attention in a bad way, to bright and noisy overall.  The grain would probably work with this shot if it was black and white but with the oranges that are showing up it detracts it from the shot for me personally.  A 5</td>', 'Where did she go?  I can see you!  Great idea and I bet you had a lot of fun shooting this one!  But then again her eyes look a little sleepy in there, hope she got a great reward for letting you bury her!   The idea is a great one, been done before no doubt but still a nice overall execution of the idea.  My biggest problem is the lack of focus through out the shot.  Maybe if you had used DOF to bring in the front and have her as a part of the background?  So you really had to search for her type thing.  The composition also leaves me wanting just a tad, the doll head in the lower right corner keeps competing for my attention in a bad way, to bright and noisy overall.  The grain would probably work with this shot if it was black and white but with the oranges that are showing up it detracts it from the shot for me personally.  A 5', '2005-11-16 01:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
