(1872437, 256311, 15711, '<td valign="top">Ok, this wins!!  Best camo shot. So artfully done.  The lighting is beautiful. You can see every hair on that fawn''s coat!!!  Just stunning.  WOW 10 10 10 10</td>', 'Ok, this wins!!  Best camo shot. So artfully done.  The lighting is beautiful. You can see every hair on that fawn''s coat!!!  Just stunning.  WOW 10 10 10 10', '2005-11-16 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
