(1872442, 257211, 15711, '<td valign="top">YES!!!  I think the lighting is a touch too harsh, but he certainly blends in.  Love the "deer in the headlights" expression. 7</td>', 'YES!!!  I think the lighting is a touch too harsh, but he certainly blends in.  Love the "deer in the headlights" expression. 7', '2005-11-16 10:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1872444, 257676, 15711, '<td valign="top">This is very artful.  How''d you do that???? I like it very much.  Extremely thought out and executed. I like the title and sentiment as well!!! 9</td>', 'This is very artful.  How''d you do that???? I like it very much.  Extremely thought out and executed. I like the title and sentiment as well!!! 9', '2005-11-16 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
