(1872454, 258213, 43774, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, I love the colours and the expression on the animal''s face (what is that, an alligator??).</td>', 'Cool photo, I love the colours and the expression on the animal''s face (what is that, an alligator??).', '2005-11-16 10:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
