(1874870, 257211, 37818, '<td valign="top">I gotta score you hi, this is just like my entry!! He''s a beauty!</td>', 'I gotta score you hi, this is just like my entry!! He''s a beauty!', '2005-11-16 20:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874909, 256172, 12448, '<td valign="top">Duck, Duck, Duck, Duck, GOOSE!  Sorry, couldn''t help myself, LOL!<br/> <br/>What a lovely image!  So quiet, serene and for you to find the duck like that there or is that a decoy?  Almost too perfect! :)<br/> <br/>But no matter, live or memorax it''s still a wonderful warm shot.  I like the setting, the lighting is very well done, the shadows with the light the oly thing that bothers me is the  things in the upper right corner.  They are competing for my attention in a bad way with the duck.  Can''t really tell what they are but one almost looks like a wooden squirrel.  A 9</td>', 'Duck, Duck, Duck, Duck, GOOSE!  Sorry, couldn''t help myself, LOL! What a lovely image!  So quiet, serene and for you to find the duck like that there or is that a decoy?  Almost too perfect! :) But no matter, live or memorax it''s still a wonderful warm shot.  I like the setting, the lighting is very well done, the shadows with the light the oly thing that bothers me is the  things in the upper right corner.  They are competing for my attention in a bad way with the duck.  Can''t really tell what they are but one almost looks like a wooden squirrel.  A 9', '2005-11-16 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874931, 257658, 12448, '<td valign="top">Aww,  how cute!  This is a very nice shot, the clarity of the subject and the colors so nice and warm.  I''m not really seeing the camouflage angle as the little caterpiller stands out very well there.  Also the light on the right side seems a bit overdone for some reason, not sure if you used flash or it was natural light but it detracts away from the overall image to me personally.  Again, a great capture,  a lovely shot overall.  A 7</td>', 'Aww,  how cute!  This is a very nice shot, the clarity of the subject and the colors so nice and warm.  I''m not really seeing the camouflage angle as the little caterpiller stands out very well there.  Also the light on the right side seems a bit overdone for some reason, not sure if you used flash or it was natural light but it detracts away from the overall image to me personally.  Again, a great capture,  a lovely shot overall.  A 7', '2005-11-16 20:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874933, 258234, 31403, '<td valign="top">the title causes me pain, but this is a stunning photo - the best of this challenge - great creative and excellent execution</td>', 'the title causes me pain, but this is a stunning photo - the best of this challenge - great creative and excellent execution', '2005-11-16 20:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874938, 258131, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, had to look at this for a second to figure out what you were doing here.  Very clever, unique and well doen.  I like the set up, the shapes, the overall composition.  Only two things bother me, the way they are lined up aka, the angle, for some reason I think it would be better going lower left to upper right, at least more I don''t know, natural for some reason but this works well also.  The other thing is the upper middle staples, they lose a lot of definition, I know you are working with as shallow DOF but it seems that at least part of it should still be visible as far a lines and such.  But again, great idea, An 8</td>', 'Hahaha, had to look at this for a second to figure out what you were doing here.  Very clever, unique and well doen.  I like the set up, the shapes, the overall composition.  Only two things bother me, the way they are lined up aka, the angle, for some reason I think it would be better going lower left to upper right, at least more I don''t know, natural for some reason but this works well also.  The other thing is the upper middle staples, they lose a lot of definition, I know you are working with as shallow DOF but it seems that at least part of it should still be visible as far a lines and such.  But again, great idea, An 8', '2005-11-16 20:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1874948, 257535, 12448, '<td valign="top">An idea that two others seem to have come up with, LOL.  I like the composition of this shot, the idea and the look on the cat''s face, so fits the title.  The things that bother me personally a bit is the the overall shot seems very dull and lacking any POW factor, maybe if you played with the levels a little bit and worked the color balance to bring out the eyes more?  Also there doesn''t seem to be any DOF on this, it all appears a little soft overall.  I like that I can see the definition of the face, just which it jumped out at me a little more.  A 7</td>', 'An idea that two others seem to have come up with, LOL.  I like the composition of this shot, the idea and the look on the cat''s face, so fits the title.  The things that bother me personally a bit is the the overall shot seems very dull and lacking any POW factor, maybe if you played with the levels a little bit and worked the color balance to bring out the eyes more?  Also there doesn''t seem to be any DOF on this, it all appears a little soft overall.  I like that I can see the definition of the face, just which it jumped out at me a little more.  A 7', '2005-11-16 20:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1875112, 258151, 43298, '<td valign="top">HA HA HA HA HA HA HA !!! This is funny. The lighting isn''t the best but anything that can make me laugh like this gets a 10 from me. Good Luck in the challenge.</td>', 'HA HA HA HA HA HA HA !!! This is funny. The lighting isn''t the best but anything that can make me laugh like this gets a 10 from me. Good Luck in the challenge.', '2005-11-16 21:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
