(1875912, 257859, 45857, '<td valign="top">I was wondering when I see one of those on the challenge, not quite what I expected.... lol</td>', 'I was wondering when I see one of those on the challenge, not quite what I expected.... lol', '2005-11-17 01:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
