(1876213, 256329, 18552, '<td valign="top">This moose really does blend into the background. It seems strange to see a moose in the sage brush, they usually like swampy places better. I think a different crop might have helped make this a stonger picture . If you cropped so the moose was either more to the right or left that would have placed it on the third making a more appealling composition.</td>', 'This moose really does blend into the background. It seems strange to see a moose in the sage brush, they usually like swampy places better. I think a different crop might have helped make this a stonger picture . If you cropped so the moose was either more to the right or left that would have placed it on the third making a more appealling composition.', '2005-11-17 05:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1876214, 258234, 18552, '<td valign="top">Suits the challenge well. Perhaps a little more contrast would have given it a bit more zing and perhaps a bit of change in the crop so her very shapely behind was more on one of the thirds. Also, the border is a bit wide for this narrow of a picture.</td>', 'Suits the challenge well. Perhaps a little more contrast would have given it a bit more zing and perhaps a bit of change in the crop so her very shapely behind was more on one of the thirds. Also, the border is a bit wide for this narrow of a picture.', '2005-11-17 05:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
