(1877013, 257593, 45790, '<td valign="top">I would have had the fence in focus instead of the person. Makes it look like you were going for a portrait but had bad lighting and annoying distractions. And what is the enemy? And why the latch key? But still an interesting picture that at least had me thinking.</td>', 'I would have had the fence in focus instead of the person. Makes it look like you were going for a portrait but had bad lighting and annoying distractions. And what is the enemy? And why the latch key? But still an interesting picture that at least had me thinking.', '2005-11-17 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
