(1877135, 258213, 43714, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I,m glad they don''t have those in my woods. Great job.</td>', 'Yikes!  I,m glad they don''t have those in my woods. Great job.', '2005-11-17 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877140, 256348, 43714, '<td valign="top">I love baby monkeys, great capture.</td>', 'I love baby monkeys, great capture.', '2005-11-17 13:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877148, 255878, 16106, '<td valign="top">great capture, the upside down look is a bit disorientating, but belivable, hawever i think it might have been more pleasing if it was inverted to a " right way up" image. Never the less it ought to be right at the top, great illustration of the challenge subject.</td>', 'great capture, the upside down look is a bit disorientating, but belivable, hawever i think it might have been more pleasing if it was inverted to a " right way up" image. Never the less it ought to be right at the top, great illustration of the challenge subject.', '2005-11-17 13:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877151, 256738, 43714, '<td valign="top">Great capture and title, love it.</td>', 'Great capture and title, love it.', '2005-11-17 13:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877154, 258234, 43714, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, good job.</td>', 'Cool idea, good job.', '2005-11-17 13:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877157, 258095, 16106, '<td valign="top">tough to use an idea that was so widely seen in a recent challenge, it is well executed but you get few points on creativity.</td>', 'tough to use an idea that was so widely seen in a recent challenge, it is well executed but you get few points on creativity.', '2005-11-17 13:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877161, 258234, 39349, '<td valign="top">AWESOME! and a fav! 10.</td>', 'AWESOME! and a fav! 10.', '2005-11-17 13:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877167, 258044, 43714, '<td valign="top">Funny frog or is it a toad</td>', 'Funny frog or is it a toad', '2005-11-17 13:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877171, 257657, 16106, '<td valign="top">this sort of still life needs to be very, very sharp to work well, the idea is good, the lighting is good, the conversion to B&amp;W seems an odd choice, but the focus is way too soft.</td>', 'this sort of still life needs to be very, very sharp to work well, the idea is good, the lighting is good, the conversion to B&W seems an odd choice, but the focus is way too soft.', '2005-11-17 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877173, 256781, 43714, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot, took me a bit to see the odd guy in the group. Good job.</td>', 'Nice clean shot, took me a bit to see the odd guy in the group. Good job.', '2005-11-17 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877175, 257663, 43714, '<td valign="top">Good camouflage shot.</td>', 'Good camouflage shot.', '2005-11-17 13:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877179, 256311, 43714, '<td valign="top">What a soft fuzzy deer, nice camouflage, beautiful shot. 10</td>', 'What a soft fuzzy deer, nice camouflage, beautiful shot. 10', '2005-11-17 13:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877187, 257733, 43714, '<td valign="top">Very well done, you can see that you went to a lot of time and effort to create this shot , well done.</td>', 'Very well done, you can see that you went to a lot of time and effort to create this shot , well done.', '2005-11-17 13:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877189, 257966, 45857, '<td valign="top">wonderfull landscape, but tough call on the camouflage. Camouflage is done with the intent of hiding something. No one has put the snow on the mountains to hide them, the mountains did not do it themselves. I''m sorry, but to me it is not camouflage.</td>', 'wonderfull landscape, but tough call on the camouflage. Camouflage is done with the intent of hiding something. No one has put the snow on the mountains to hide them, the mountains did not do it themselves. I''m sorry, but to me it is not camouflage.', '2005-11-17 14:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877190, 258045, 43714, '<td valign="top">Thats funny , I like this shot.</td>', 'Thats funny , I like this shot.', '2005-11-17 14:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877197, 258148, 39349, '<td valign="top">Would like to see a different crop on this. Say, crop the top 1/3rd out of the shot? Good clean shot, with great colors and lighting.</td>', 'Would like to see a different crop on this. Say, crop the top 1/3rd out of the shot? Good clean shot, with great colors and lighting.', '2005-11-17 14:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877199, 258151, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very creative and well done.</td>', 'Very creative and well done.', '2005-11-17 14:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877201, 257951, 70, '<td valign="top">While I''m guessing that in the overall scene, the owl was well camoflauged, the picture doesn''t really portray that. He''s pretty front and center there. There''s nice detail in the shot but it''s also fairly backlit.</td>', 'While I''m guessing that in the overall scene, the owl was well camoflauged, the picture doesn''t really portray that. He''s pretty front and center there. There''s nice detail in the shot but it''s also fairly backlit.', '2005-11-17 14:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877203, 256686, 45857, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but could have been stronger on camouflage. The child is wearing an orange top, which blends with the leaves. Perhaps if he/she was holding up a couple leaves it would have worked even better.</td>', 'Cute picture, but could have been stronger on camouflage. The child is wearing an orange top, which blends with the leaves. Perhaps if he/she was holding up a couple leaves it would have worked even better.', '2005-11-17 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877204, 256886, 70, '<td valign="top">Wow, neat paintings. Unfortuantely, not really representative of camoflauge for me.</td>', 'Wow, neat paintings. Unfortuantely, not really representative of camoflauge for me.', '2005-11-17 14:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877207, 257765, 8367, '<td valign="top">Great capture. I don''t think they''re camouflaged, though. It would work if the background was the same colors as the birds. Very crisp detail.</td>', 'Great capture. I don''t think they''re camouflaged, though. It would work if the background was the same colors as the birds. Very crisp detail.', '2005-11-17 14:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877209, 256312, 70, '<td valign="top">This photo doesn''t really represent camoflauge to me. As far as the shot itself, it''s a nice scene but it''s generally a good idea to give moving subjects room to move in the frame. In this case, they''re walking out of the frame. Granted, I don''t know what''s to the right so maybe you couldn''t have composed it differently.</td>', 'This photo doesn''t really represent camoflauge to me. As far as the shot itself, it''s a nice scene but it''s generally a good idea to give moving subjects room to move in the frame. In this case, they''re walking out of the frame. Granted, I don''t know what''s to the right so maybe you couldn''t have composed it differently.', '2005-11-17 14:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877211, 257740, 45857, '<td valign="top">He should of worn his ''urban fence'' outfit.<br/>Nice shot, well done.</td>', 'He should of worn his ''urban fence'' outfit.Nice shot, well done.', '2005-11-17 14:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877212, 257582, 70, '<td valign="top">Cute. :)</td>', 'Cute. :)', '2005-11-17 14:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877215, 258082, 45857, '<td valign="top">This would have been stronger if the toe nails were painted (joking)<br/>Only weakness is crowding the lower edge. gets a 9 from me.</td>', 'This would have been stronger if the toe nails were painted (joking)Only weakness is crowding the lower edge. gets a 9 from me.', '2005-11-17 14:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877217, 256819, 70, '<td valign="top">Ooh, excellent camoflauge! And kind of gross, too. Nice, crisp shot, good DOF.</td>', 'Ooh, excellent camoflauge! And kind of gross, too. Nice, crisp shot, good DOF.', '2005-11-17 14:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877224, 256728, 70, '<td valign="top">A good idea for camoflauge but the purple area to the right is quite distracting (and confusing as I can''t really make out why it''s purple.)</td>', 'A good idea for camoflauge but the purple area to the right is quite distracting (and confusing as I can''t really make out why it''s purple.)', '2005-11-17 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877230, 256781, 43369, '<td valign="top">Clever camo. I like the low angle of the shot makes the cans feel huge.</td>', 'Clever camo. I like the low angle of the shot makes the cans feel huge.', '2005-11-17 14:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877240, 256781, 46172, '<td valign="top">OO nice idea, i love the angle you put this in! good job!</td>', 'OO nice idea, i love the angle you put this in! good job!', '2005-11-17 14:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877241, 257859, 43369, '<td valign="top">You park that in the snow! I hope its not yours. Nice exposure considering all the white.</td>', 'You park that in the snow! I hope its not yours. Nice exposure considering all the white.', '2005-11-17 14:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877244, 257733, 46172, '<td valign="top">this is awesome....nice camouflage!!!</td>', 'this is awesome....nice camouflage!!!', '2005-11-17 14:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877247, 255746, 43369, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this. Very effective.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this. Very effective.', '2005-11-17 14:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877248, 258077, 46172, '<td valign="top">seems kinda blurry, but i love the angle of the first zebra, draws my eye to the second one</td>', 'seems kinda blurry, but i love the angle of the first zebra, draws my eye to the second one', '2005-11-17 14:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877249, 258234, 46172, '<td valign="top">i like this, its catchy...good job trying to blend in</td>', 'i like this, its catchy...good job trying to blend in', '2005-11-17 14:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877255, 256691, 18552, '<td valign="top">This picture suits the challenge very well. I like the cold dreary look of it. The composition might be better if the bird was on one of the third. Also, if the focus on the bird were a bit sharper it would really add to your picture.</td>', 'This picture suits the challenge very well. I like the cold dreary look of it. The composition might be better if the bird was on one of the third. Also, if the focus on the bird were a bit sharper it would really add to your picture.', '2005-11-17 14:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877258, 258124, 43369, '<td valign="top">I hope you didn''t eat the apple after this shot! I like the set-up, maybe a little too much light reflected on the upper right orange.</td>', 'I hope you didn''t eat the apple after this shot! I like the set-up, maybe a little too much light reflected on the upper right orange.', '2005-11-17 14:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877261, 258031, 12448, '<td valign="top">Well, yes, they are used for camouflage but I don''t see that they are currently being used for that purpose.  And they are fake ones also, right?  No points off for that, it''s just that I could tell from the way the light is hitting some of the leaves and the little nobbin thing on the lower right side.  <br/> <br/>As for the picture, yes, very nice, good overall composition and interesting use of the light.  I like the shadows and light but on the right side it''s just a tad too bright on the one leave, almost a blow out light but the rest is very nice.  The material of the leaves make if feel like the entire shot has a soft focus to it and it does work in this instance, normally I''m not a big fan of soft focus unless it really works with the photo and in your case I personally feel it does.  I would like not to see that nobbin over on the right side, it probably wouldn''t be that noticable except for the bright light right by it.  End result, a 7 :)</td>', 'Well, yes, they are used for camouflage but I don''t see that they are currently being used for that purpose.  And they are fake ones also, right?  No points off for that, it''s just that I could tell from the way the light is hitting some of the leaves and the little nobbin thing on the lower right side.   As for the picture, yes, very nice, good overall composition and interesting use of the light.  I like the shadows and light but on the right side it''s just a tad too bright on the one leave, almost a blow out light but the rest is very nice.  The material of the leaves make if feel like the entire shot has a soft focus to it and it does work in this instance, normally I''m not a big fan of soft focus unless it really works with the photo and in your case I personally feel it does.  I would like not to see that nobbin over on the right side, it probably wouldn''t be that noticable except for the bright light right by it.  End result, a 7 :)', '2005-11-17 14:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877262, 256303, 18552, '<td valign="top">This picture suits the challenge very well. It is clear and well taken, too. However, I think the composition could be improved by putting the butterfly on one of the thirds. Also, if the whole butterfly was in the picture it would be more visually appealling.</td>', 'This picture suits the challenge very well. It is clear and well taken, too. However, I think the composition could be improved by putting the butterfly on one of the thirds. Also, if the whole butterfly was in the picture it would be more visually appealling.', '2005-11-17 14:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877263, 257591, 33068, '<td valign="top">Oh wow.  Nice colors and excellent dof.</td>', 'Oh wow.  Nice colors and excellent dof.', '2005-11-17 14:25:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877265, 258225, 43369, '<td valign="top">Maybe my monitor, but it just feels a little too dark. Otherwise I like the composition.</td>', 'Maybe my monitor, but it just feels a little too dark. Otherwise I like the composition.', '2005-11-17 14:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877266, 258155, 45857, '<td valign="top">Completely confounded by the concepts contained. <br/>I can see where your going with this, but IMO its pretty thin. Camouflage has to do disguising with intent to conceal. While you have choosen a angle which hides the festival behind the whatever, each exists independently.  5 for effort</td>', 'Completely confounded by the concepts contained. I can see where your going with this, but IMO its pretty thin. Camouflage has to do disguising with intent to conceal. While you have choosen a angle which hides the festival behind the whatever, each exists independently.  5 for effort', '2005-11-17 14:26:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1877270, 257787, 43369, '<td valign="top">Creative. Good close up, nice lighting.</td>', 'Creative. Good close up, nice lighting.', '2005-11-17 14:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877271, 256686, 43369, '<td valign="top">Colors work perfectly to hide the child. Very good.</td>', 'Colors work perfectly to hide the child. Very good.', '2005-11-17 14:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877273, 257583, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hey, you almost got me, I had to look twice to see it wasn''t the actual Statue of Liberty, LOL!  Welld one!<br/> <br/>I''m getting the feeling there is a double meaning to this shot but I''m not going to get into that discussion, instead I''ll just comment on the photograph itself.<br/> <br/>First, BRAVO!  Great idea, nice concept and excellent overall composition of the shot.  I like the use of the color on this one, the cold, forbidding blue and the way ''Lady Liberty'' has her back turned to the camera really accents that color choice.  The use of grain is also a bonus on this one.  I normally hate grainy shots but this one works and works well.  The cropping seems a tad off for some reason, maybe if it was just a touch tighter on the top so the torch is closer to the edge?  Then to me you would have two exits on the shot, bringing them in on the right with the ''crown'' and they can be lead out on the other side of the crown or the torch if the crop on top was tighter.  An 8</td>', 'Hey, you almost got me, I had to look twice to see it wasn''t the actual Statue of Liberty, LOL!  Welld one! I''m getting the feeling there is a double meaning to this shot but I''m not going to get into that discussion, instead I''ll just comment on the photograph itself. First, BRAVO!  Great idea, nice concept and excellent overall composition of the shot.  I like the use of the color on this one, the cold, forbidding blue and the way ''Lady Liberty'' has her back turned to the camera really accents that color choice.  The use of grain is also a bonus on this one.  I normally hate grainy shots but this one works and works well.  The cropping seems a tad off for some reason, maybe if it was just a touch tighter on the top so the torch is closer to the edge?  Then to me you would have two exits on the shot, bringing them in on the right with the ''crown'' and they can be lead out on the other side of the crown or the torch if the crop on top was tighter.  An 8', '2005-11-17 14:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877275, 258251, 18552, '<td valign="top">What a pretty picture - it suits the challenge perfectly! I think the composition would be stronger if you had rotated and then cropped so the the back edge of the wings made a diagonal across the picture with the tips of the wings on either third.</td>', 'What a pretty picture - it suits the challenge perfectly! I think the composition would be stronger if you had rotated and then cropped so the the back edge of the wings made a diagonal across the picture with the tips of the wings on either third.', '2005-11-17 14:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1877277, 258191, 33068, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a "Chucky" movie.  The bold deep red is perfect for the mood of the picture.  I like it.</td>', 'Reminds me of a "Chucky" movie.  The bold deep red is perfect for the mood of the picture.  I like it.', '2005-11-17 14:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
