(1878124, 256819, 43148, '<td valign="top">do not believe that is a spider, but a moot point as far as photo is concerned, very good example and very good photo, only small thing is the three rear legs are a little oof to me, hard to get everything in focus with nature I know, but it is very slightly distracting</td>', 'do not believe that is a spider, but a moot point as far as photo is concerned, very good example and very good photo, only small thing is the three rear legs are a little oof to me, hard to get everything in focus with nature I know, but it is very slightly distracting', '2005-11-17 20:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878130, 258251, 43148, '<td valign="top">well done, only small (very small) distraction for me is the way the bright light shines through, hard to do much about I know, loved it overall</td>', 'well done, only small (very small) distraction for me is the way the bright light shines through, hard to do much about I know, loved it overall', '2005-11-17 20:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878132, 257959, 43148, '<td valign="top">well done, great macro shot, I know I am in the minority, but for me would have done better with an actual natural (but very subued) background, the solid black works with this - no doubt, I just prefer a more natural background for nature shots!</td>', 'well done, great macro shot, I know I am in the minority, but for me would have done better with an actual natural (but very subued) background, the solid black works with this - no doubt, I just prefer a more natural background for nature shots!', '2005-11-17 20:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878139, 258245, 39232, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very cool shot. Had to do a double take, I thought it was just stripes at first. Awesome!</td>', 'Wow! Very cool shot. Had to do a double take, I thought it was just stripes at first. Awesome!', '2005-11-17 20:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878140, 255878, 43148, '<td valign="top">well done, love the interplay between two of natures best hunters,  the spider does not stand much of a chance if the encounter went on to conflict, but love the photo - to me if you lose any points, maybe the fact that the photo APPEARS to be upside down (know it is not), should not, but that may be a terrible reason to deduct points ( have seen others that actually turned theirs 180 degrees), just a thought</td>', 'well done, love the interplay between two of natures best hunters,  the spider does not stand much of a chance if the encounter went on to conflict, but love the photo - to me if you lose any points, maybe the fact that the photo APPEARS to be upside down (know it is not), should not, but that may be a terrible reason to deduct points ( have seen others that actually turned theirs 180 degrees), just a thought', '2005-11-17 20:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878168, 258084, 36832, '<td valign="top">I like that you took a chance on your photo and that you didn''t do the conventional photograph, but I''m not so sure that you''ll get the popular vote on this one.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like that you took a chance on your photo and that you didn''t do the conventional photograph, but I''m not so sure that you''ll get the popular vote on this one.  Good luck!', '2005-11-17 20:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878175, 256312, 36832, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s camouflaged here but I''ll definitely keep a look out to see there was something I missed.  Nice beach, however. :)  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s camouflaged here but I''ll definitely keep a look out to see there was something I missed.  Nice beach, however. :)  Good luck.', '2005-11-17 20:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878180, 258104, 36832, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo but I''m not sure if it''s necessarily camouflaged.  Good luck.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo but I''m not sure if it''s necessarily camouflaged.  Good luck.', '2005-11-17 20:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878187, 257674, 36832, '<td valign="top">Ok, so your title''s got me looking all over this photo for something "concealed," but I guess it must be really good bc I just can''t find it!  Good luck.  Must be a really good camo. :)</td>', 'Ok, so your title''s got me looking all over this photo for something "concealed," but I guess it must be really good bc I just can''t find it!  Good luck.  Must be a really good camo. :)', '2005-11-17 20:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878193, 258044, 36832, '<td valign="top">This is the creepiest looking frog I''ve ever seen and I watch a lot of outdoor programming!  :)  Good luck.  The title totally fits the photo.</td>', 'This is the creepiest looking frog I''ve ever seen and I watch a lot of outdoor programming!  :)  Good luck.  The title totally fits the photo.', '2005-11-17 20:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878276, 256303, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good clarity and coloring.  Criticism; obviously, the ''cropping'', although, especially for this Challenge, the ''crop'' enhances the camouflage, I still think it may have worked as well, if not better, uncropped, but don''t know what you had to work with or what camouflage effect is lost in doing so if possible so, not sure.</td>', '8 - Very good clarity and coloring.  Criticism; obviously, the ''cropping'', although, especially for this Challenge, the ''crop'' enhances the camouflage, I still think it may have worked as well, if not better, uncropped, but don''t know what you had to work with or what camouflage effect is lost in doing so if possible so, not sure.', '2005-11-17 20:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878285, 258104, 35739, '<td valign="top">What is the relationship between camo and the chimes?  The image is out of focus.  The composition and content is not very appealing.  Help me with this.</td>', 'What is the relationship between camo and the chimes?  The image is out of focus.  The composition and content is not very appealing.  Help me with this.', '2005-11-17 21:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878294, 257179, 35739, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Personally I do not care for the grainy look.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Personally I do not care for the grainy look.', '2005-11-17 21:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878300, 258123, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good macro and coloring.  Criticism; even though I like the added ''context'' by the inclusion of more stem/flowers, I think, if possible, an even tighter crop/zoom would have worked well.  Difficult to tell (and indeed do), but perhaps a little more sharpness, ''somehow'' on the assassin, would have made this even better.  Good capture and timing.  Title is perhaps a little too ''spelled out'' for the Challenge, in my opinion.</td>', '8 - Good macro and coloring.  Criticism; even though I like the added ''context'' by the inclusion of more stem/flowers, I think, if possible, an even tighter crop/zoom would have worked well.  Difficult to tell (and indeed do), but perhaps a little more sharpness, ''somehow'' on the assassin, would have made this even better.  Good capture and timing.  Title is perhaps a little too ''spelled out'' for the Challenge, in my opinion.', '2005-11-17 21:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878304, 256845, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good meet of the Challenge.  Good coloring.  Criticism; not much, maybe a different ''composition''/placing/crop, not sure.  Maybe, a small frame, though not sure on that.</td>', '8 - Very good meet of the Challenge.  Good coloring.  Criticism; not much, maybe a different ''composition''/placing/crop, not sure.  Maybe, a small frame, though not sure on that.', '2005-11-17 21:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878308, 255897, 35739, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea here.  Do not like how you executed it.  Not really sure how to assist you here. Lighting and clarity on the grain is undesireable to me. The shadow is very grainy.</td>', 'Interesting idea here.  Do not like how you executed it.  Not really sure how to assist you here. Lighting and clarity on the grain is undesireable to me. The shadow is very grainy.', '2005-11-17 21:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878309, 257349, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good aquarium shot, they are not easy.  Good colors and ''composition''.  Criticism; just a little sharper on the crab, especially the ''fore parts'', would have made this even better in my opinion, but very difficult to do.  Not sure on the white with the frame, it works, but not sure it enhances the shot to the full potential.</td>', '8 - Very good aquarium shot, they are not easy.  Good colors and ''composition''.  Criticism; just a little sharper on the crab, especially the ''fore parts'', would have made this even better in my opinion, but very difficult to do.  Not sure on the white with the frame, it works, but not sure it enhances the shot to the full potential.', '2005-11-17 21:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878316, 257180, 35739, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of noise in this image.  What is the relationship to your image and camo?  I hate to say this it looks to me as if the image was accidently taken.  Oh well! Nice try.</td>', 'There is a lot of noise in this image.  What is the relationship to your image and camo?  I hate to say this it looks to me as if the image was accidently taken.  Oh well! Nice try.', '2005-11-17 21:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878321, 257959, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good meet of the Challenge.  Good colors/contrast control, while retaining definition in the hairs, etc.  Criticism; despite that contrast comment, seems a little ''blown'' (or whatever the correct term is, ie bottom right of ''leaves'' and ''in between'' the spider''s eyes) in some areas but difficult to control this I imagine, however this looks like a studio set up (apologies if wrong) so maybe the use of ''cards/boxes'' whatever, may have helped, not sure, don''t have enough knowledge to suggest anything there.</td>', '8 - Very good meet of the Challenge.  Good colors/contrast control, while retaining definition in the hairs, etc.  Criticism; despite that contrast comment, seems a little ''blown'' (or whatever the correct term is, ie bottom right of ''leaves'' and ''in between'' the spider''s eyes) in some areas but difficult to control this I imagine, however this looks like a studio set up (apologies if wrong) so maybe the use of ''cards/boxes'' whatever, may have helped, not sure, don''t have enough knowledge to suggest anything there.', '2005-11-17 21:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878326, 256254, 35739, '<td valign="top">Focus is a big issue here.  I would have liked to see the bird better, perhaps alittle closer.  Its very hard to see the bird, not due to its color but its size.</td>', 'Focus is a big issue here.  I would have liked to see the bird better, perhaps alittle closer.  Its very hard to see the bird, not due to its color but its size.', '2005-11-17 21:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878332, 256772, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very nice capture.  Nice colors.  Criticism; like to see the colors even bolder if possible, but difficult with aquarium shots.  Even more definition too on the seahorse, but again, difficult.  Even though you haven''t captured the seahorse close to a rock etc, to really emphasize the camouflage, this still works with the background, but I think had it been ''closer'' to a rock/coral etc, would have made this even better, especially for the Challenge.</td>', '8 - Very nice capture.  Nice colors.  Criticism; like to see the colors even bolder if possible, but difficult with aquarium shots.  Even more definition too on the seahorse, but again, difficult.  Even though you haven''t captured the seahorse close to a rock etc, to really emphasize the camouflage, this still works with the background, but I think had it been ''closer'' to a rock/coral etc, would have made this even better, especially for the Challenge.', '2005-11-17 21:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878333, 257374, 35739, '<td valign="top">I personnally do not care for the effects here.</td>', 'I personnally do not care for the effects here.', '2005-11-17 21:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878336, 258158, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Good meet of Challenge.  Very nice colors.  Criticism; different composition if possible, either sharper angle (face more at the fore), or the inclusion of the entire body, depending what you had to work with, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult with such a small snake though.</td>', '8 - Good meet of Challenge.  Very nice colors.  Criticism; different composition if possible, either sharper angle (face more at the fore), or the inclusion of the entire body, depending what you had to work with, may have made this even better in my opinion.  Difficult with such a small snake though.', '2005-11-17 21:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878351, 257211, 35739, '<td valign="top">Good idea here.  The lighting on the cat needs work to me.  Very bright at the ears and mouth. Soft lighting rather than a flash may have been better.</td>', 'Good idea here.  The lighting on the cat needs work to me.  Very bright at the ears and mouth. Soft lighting rather than a flash may have been better.', '2005-11-17 21:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878354, 255878, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good, and two for one meet of the Challenge.  Criticism; very difficult given the composition and inclusion of the two ''characters'', but maybe a slightly different cropping.  Would like to say different angle, but I am sure this was an opportune capture as is.  Definition is good on both but would like to have seen perhaps a touch more as well as more vivid (especially in the green) colors, again though, difficult with the resulting contrast issues I imagine, as well as retaining definition in both ''characters'' at once, in a macro.</td>', '8 - Very good, and two for one meet of the Challenge.  Criticism; very difficult given the composition and inclusion of the two ''characters'', but maybe a slightly different cropping.  Would like to say different angle, but I am sure this was an opportune capture as is.  Definition is good on both but would like to have seen perhaps a touch more as well as more vivid (especially in the green) colors, again though, difficult with the resulting contrast issues I imagine, as well as retaining definition in both ''characters'' at once, in a macro.', '2005-11-17 21:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878364, 256738, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - I belief it.  I also belief you may have set this up (obviously with the orange), so well done.  Excellent meet of the Challenge, even without a background to blend into/illustrate the camouflage.  Criticism; not much, like to see it even ''crisper'', but imagine that is very difficult.  Colors are nice, maybe a different colored plate(?) may have enhanced this even more, not sure.</td>', '8 - I belief it.  I also belief you may have set this up (obviously with the orange), so well done.  Excellent meet of the Challenge, even without a background to blend into/illustrate the camouflage.  Criticism; not much, like to see it even ''crisper'', but imagine that is very difficult.  Colors are nice, maybe a different colored plate(?) may have enhanced this even more, not sure.', '2005-11-17 21:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878369, 255907, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Very good capture in seemingly natural surrounds.  Criticism; just a touch more sharpness, especially around the face, as is on the fore ''rocks'', would have made this even better in my opinion, but obviously very difficult with an ''opportunity capture'', depending how long ''it'' stayed still for.  Maybe a tighter crop, sacrificing some of the left rear background, and bringing the lizard more to the ''fore'', may have made this better too, but unsure as I do like seeing it in this context.</td>', '8 - Very good capture in seemingly natural surrounds.  Criticism; just a touch more sharpness, especially around the face, as is on the fore ''rocks'', would have made this even better in my opinion, but obviously very difficult with an ''opportunity capture'', depending how long ''it'' stayed still for.  Maybe a tighter crop, sacrificing some of the left rear background, and bringing the lizard more to the ''fore'', may have made this better too, but unsure as I do like seeing it in this context.', '2005-11-17 21:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878376, 257302, 47207, '<td valign="top">fabulous picture!!</td>', 'fabulous picture!!', '2005-11-17 21:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878381, 257591, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent colors and capture.  Criticism; maybe just a fraction less of the fore ''blur'', even though it does add to the shot, not sure.  Perhaps more crop off the top too, making the stag(?) ''feature'' more, don''t know.  Good with the limbs/trunks/branches in the background behind it''s antlers, very good meet of the Challenge.</td>', '8 - Excellent colors and capture.  Criticism; maybe just a fraction less of the fore ''blur'', even though it does add to the shot, not sure.  Perhaps more crop off the top too, making the stag(?) ''feature'' more, don''t know.  Good with the limbs/trunks/branches in the background behind it''s antlers, very good meet of the Challenge.', '2005-11-17 21:22:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878387, 257302, 39850, '<td valign="top">8 - Excellent meet of the Challenge.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, as the detail is very good and would get ''lost'' with a different crop likely, but would like to have seen the inclusion of the antennae (the one that has been cropped and the one that is out of focus), but a very difficult shot to get I imagine.  Also the ''rear'' too included would have probably made this even better in my opinion.   Good capture in a seemingly natural environment.</td>', '8 - Excellent meet of the Challenge.  Good colors.  Criticism; difficult, as the detail is very good and would get ''lost'' with a different crop likely, but would like to have seen the inclusion of the antennae (the one that has been cropped and the one that is out of focus), but a very difficult shot to get I imagine.  Also the ''rear'' too included would have probably made this even better in my opinion.   Good capture in a seemingly natural environment.', '2005-11-17 21:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878429, 257765, 12448, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, this makes me smile.  I love Macaws, they are so personalble and sweet yet at the same time like having a 3 year old forever, LOL:)<br/> <br/>This is a wonderful shot, as far as meeting the challenge, that''s a bit of a push IMO, so we will so strictly on the shot itself.  I like the composure of the shot, and even though the branch is leaning from one side to the other, a little pet peeve that might normally drive me bonkers, ;-), it works for this shot because the wing also leads right up.  The expression in their eyes is wonderful and the lighting is well done.  That branch looks like it''s ready to break though, should be interesting when it does!  THe colors are also great but could take just a tweak to really make them pop out at you, these birds are so colorful in real life and it''s hard to express that on screen at times.  The crop on the sides works well since each bird had a little bit of feather cut off so overall, very nicely done, a 7</td>', 'Hahaha, this makes me smile.  I love Macaws, they are so personalble and sweet yet at the same time like having a 3 year old forever, LOL:) This is a wonderful shot, as far as meeting the challenge, that''s a bit of a push IMO, so we will so strictly on the shot itself.  I like the composure of the shot, and even though the branch is leaning from one side to the other, a little pet peeve that might normally drive me bonkers, ;-), it works for this shot because the wing also leads right up.  The expression in their eyes is wonderful and the lighting is well done.  That branch looks like it''s ready to break though, should be interesting when it does!  THe colors are also great but could take just a tweak to really make them pop out at you, these birds are so colorful in real life and it''s hard to express that on screen at times.  The crop on the sides works well since each bird had a little bit of feather cut off so overall, very nicely done, a 7', '2005-11-17 21:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1878467, 258234, 33672, '<td valign="top">Original and interesting, not to mention tastefull</td>', 'Original and interesting, not to mention tastefull', '2005-11-17 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
