(1879004, 258082, 46468, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge, however the white on the toenails is distracting and causes the feet to not be as "camouflaged" as they could have been.</td>', 'Fits challenge, however the white on the toenails is distracting and causes the feet to not be as "camouflaged" as they could have been.', '2005-11-17 23:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879020, 256738, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, IMO I think it would have been great to have some real leaves in the background to really show off his "camo" Good luck in the challenge</td>', 'Nice capture, IMO I think it would have been great to have some real leaves in the background to really show off his "camo" Good luck in the challenge', '2005-11-18 00:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879026, 257534, 46468, '<td valign="top">The squirrel blends in well with his surroundings, love the way he appears to be holding the leaf to hide behind. IMO, the photo is a little hazy and the focus a tad to soft on the squirrel.</td>', 'The squirrel blends in well with his surroundings, love the way he appears to be holding the leaf to hide behind. IMO, the photo is a little hazy and the focus a tad to soft on the squirrel.', '2005-11-18 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879031, 257302, 46468, '<td valign="top">nice focus on the katydid, colors are a great match to the leaf he is on. Good luck, Nice capture</td>', 'nice focus on the katydid, colors are a great match to the leaf he is on. Good luck, Nice capture', '2005-11-18 00:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879042, 258044, 46468, '<td valign="top">Title definately describes the pose, the green stem even looks like the starting line, of course he is cheating, he should be behind the line LOL. Nice capture, wish the focus was a tad tighter on the nose, but really love the eye. Good luck</td>', 'Title definately describes the pose, the green stem even looks like the starting line, of course he is cheating, he should be behind the line LOL. Nice capture, wish the focus was a tad tighter on the nose, but really love the eye. Good luck', '2005-11-18 00:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879051, 258245, 46468, '<td valign="top">Really did well matching the pattern, esp. on the lower cheek. Nicely done, the only thing I see that is detracting is the few stray hairs, otherwise great.</td>', 'Really did well matching the pattern, esp. on the lower cheek. Nicely done, the only thing I see that is detracting is the few stray hairs, otherwise great.', '2005-11-18 00:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879060, 258231, 46468, '<td valign="top">Different. Like how the hands were painted to match the frame.  The ties on the persons right hand almost match the indentation of the frame, however the left hand is reversed which is distracting to me. IMO would have added a little more punch if there was a black cloth attached to the bottom of the frame to hide the persons body below the frame. Just my opinion. Good luck</td>', 'Different. Like how the hands were painted to match the frame.  The ties on the persons right hand almost match the indentation of the frame, however the left hand is reversed which is distracting to me. IMO would have added a little more punch if there was a black cloth attached to the bottom of the frame to hide the persons body below the frame. Just my opinion. Good luck', '2005-11-18 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879066, 258003, 46468, '<td valign="top">Definately blends into the wall, IMO the focus on the lizard is a little soft though. Still a nice capture</td>', 'Definately blends into the wall, IMO the focus on the lizard is a little soft though. Still a nice capture', '2005-11-18 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879122, 257706, 45925, '<td valign="top">this is nice i like the scenery. the green is beautiful</td>', 'this is nice i like the scenery. the green is beautiful', '2005-11-18 00:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879181, 255972, 40465, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!</td>', 'Nice shot!', '2005-11-18 01:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879182, 258158, 40465, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! I love the colours!! It looks very nice!</td>', 'Very nice shot! I love the colours!! It looks very nice!', '2005-11-18 01:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879183, 258105, 48222, '<td valign="top">id get your carpets cleaned</td>', 'id get your carpets cleaned', '2005-11-18 01:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879184, 258213, 40465, '<td valign="top">Ha ha! Like the title! A very good pic! I like it!</td>', 'Ha ha! Like the title! A very good pic! I like it!', '2005-11-18 01:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879201, 258142, 44086, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and concept. Little uncomfortable with the crop. Seems to be leaning off to the right bottom.</td>', 'Nice colors and concept. Little uncomfortable with the crop. Seems to be leaning off to the right bottom.', '2005-11-18 01:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879221, 256728, 44086, '<td valign="top">Better if the crop were squared to the waterline. Also a higher shutter speed could save some highlights from burning out.</td>', 'Better if the crop were squared to the waterline. Also a higher shutter speed could save some highlights from burning out.', '2005-11-18 01:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879270, 257349, 16106, '<td valign="top">There are some lovely aquarium shots in this challenge but this might well be the best. great lighting and framing.</td>', 'There are some lovely aquarium shots in this challenge but this might well be the best. great lighting and framing.', '2005-11-18 02:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879399, 257988, 27482, '<td valign="top">Too bad about the focus, I would probably have liked this if it had been in tack sharp focus.  Fits the challenge though.</td>', 'Too bad about the focus, I would probably have liked this if it had been in tack sharp focus.  Fits the challenge though.', '2005-11-18 05:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879406, 257733, 27482, '<td valign="top">Lol!  Looks like you have way too much time on your hands.  Nice idea but falls a little short IMHO as the spots don´t line up (some aren´t even close), that and that just the tip of her left foot is cut off like that.  Good imagination though, I like your approach on the challenge.</td>', 'Lol!  Looks like you have way too much time on your hands.  Nice idea but falls a little short IMHO as the spots don´t line up (some aren´t even close), that and that just the tip of her left foot is cut off like that.  Good imagination though, I like your approach on the challenge.', '2005-11-18 05:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879407, 257993, 48043, '<td valign="top">nice idea</td>', 'nice idea', '2005-11-18 05:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879408, 257759, 27482, '<td valign="top">Huh?  Don´t really get how this should fit the challenge, since when are eagles known for their camouflage?  Just wanted to let you know why I only gave this a 3 as I like this shot, just don´t think it fits the challenge.  The image quality is very good, like the sharpness and the DOF.</td>', 'Huh?  Don´t really get how this should fit the challenge, since when are eagles known for their camouflage?  Just wanted to let you know why I only gave this a 3 as I like this shot, just don´t think it fits the challenge.  The image quality is very good, like the sharpness and the DOF.', '2005-11-18 05:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879415, 256845, 27482, '<td valign="top">Like this shot, great image quality and very fitting for the challenge.  Only to nitpick, there is a straw in the bottom right corner that is out of focus but still very distracting but no spot editing of course, I assume you would have removed if you had the option.  7 from me.</td>', 'Like this shot, great image quality and very fitting for the challenge.  Only to nitpick, there is a straw in the bottom right corner that is out of focus but still very distracting but no spot editing of course, I assume you would have removed if you had the option.  7 from me.', '2005-11-18 05:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879419, 257302, 27482, '<td valign="top">Wow!  How did yo find this little bugger, he almost completely blends in.  Only to nitpick, I am not really fond of the composition, both the angle it´s shot at and the fact that you cut off just a tiny portion of the backside.  I don´t want to jinx you but if this doesn´t make it to the top 10 I would really be surprised.  9 from me.</td>', 'Wow!  How did yo find this little bugger, he almost completely blends in.  Only to nitpick, I am not really fond of the composition, both the angle it´s shot at and the fact that you cut off just a tiny portion of the backside.  I don´t want to jinx you but if this doesn´t make it to the top 10 I would really be surprised.  9 from me.', '2005-11-18 05:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879421, 257740, 27482, '<td valign="top">My first impression when seeing this shot was "why did the photographer make this shot black and white?"  It somehow doesn´t fit with the challenge as the whole concept of camouflage is to blend in with the colours in the environment.  Still very funny and I like the idea, you got a 6 from me.</td>', 'My first impression when seeing this shot was "why did the photographer make this shot black and white?"  It somehow doesn´t fit with the challenge as the whole concept of camouflage is to blend in with the colours in the environment.  Still very funny and I like the idea, you got a 6 from me.', '2005-11-18 05:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879422, 258231, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very symmetrical, it works nicely and the idea is good an executed well, just doesn´t have any "wow" value with me but technically it´s very well done, you got a 7 from me.</td>', 'Very symmetrical, it works nicely and the idea is good an executed well, just doesn´t have any "wow" value with me but technically it´s very well done, you got a 7 from me.', '2005-11-18 05:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879423, 258128, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the short DOF here as it works out that the eye to the right is out of focus.  If you had to have the aperture so big I would rather have it the other way around, the eye to the right in focus and the one to the left out of focus as my vision is more drawn to the eye to the right.  Shot itself is good but need something to make it "pop" more.</td>', 'Not really fond of the short DOF here as it works out that the eye to the right is out of focus.  If you had to have the aperture so big I would rather have it the other way around, the eye to the right in focus and the one to the left out of focus as my vision is more drawn to the eye to the right.  Shot itself is good but need something to make it "pop" more.', '2005-11-18 05:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879424, 258044, 27482, '<td valign="top">Not really fond of the frame but the shot itself is good, love the image quality and the title helps, one of the better shots in the challenge, gave it a 7.</td>', 'Not really fond of the frame but the shot itself is good, love the image quality and the title helps, one of the better shots in the challenge, gave it a 7.', '2005-11-18 05:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879425, 257374, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry but the cheap photoshop effect is just not flattering at all and if that isn´t bad enough I don´t really see how this fit´s the challenge.  I assume the truck is painted in military camouflage colours but there is just no way of telling because of the effect you put on the shot so I voted as if it didn´t meet the challenge and frankly I gave this a 1, a rating I don´t give out often.  However, if YOU like this then I encourage you to keep it up as that is all that should matter, what the hell do I know anyway.</td>', 'Sorry but the cheap photoshop effect is just not flattering at all and if that isn´t bad enough I don´t really see how this fit´s the challenge.  I assume the truck is painted in military camouflage colours but there is just no way of telling because of the effect you put on the shot so I voted as if it didn´t meet the challenge and frankly I gave this a 1, a rating I don´t give out often.  However, if YOU like this then I encourage you to keep it up as that is all that should matter, what the hell do I know anyway.', '2005-11-18 05:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879428, 258225, 27482, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not fond of the lighting here and I frankly don´t understand why you didn´t take this shot during the daytime somewhere with a forest behind it or whatever.  The first thing that popped into my mind when I saw it was that this just screamed at me "this person didn´t put a lot of effort into this challenge at all..."<br/> <br/>Fit´s the challenge though so I still gave it a 4.</td>', 'Sorry, not fond of the lighting here and I frankly don´t understand why you didn´t take this shot during the daytime somewhere with a forest behind it or whatever.  The first thing that popped into my mind when I saw it was that this just screamed at me "this person didn´t put a lot of effort into this challenge at all..." Fit´s the challenge though so I still gave it a 4.', '2005-11-18 05:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879432, 256450, 27482, '<td valign="top">Huh?  How is this camouflage?  Just wanted to leave a comment as to why I only gave this a 3, like the shot but doesn´t meet the challenge as far as I am concerned.</td>', 'Huh?  How is this camouflage?  Just wanted to leave a comment as to why I only gave this a 3, like the shot but doesn´t meet the challenge as far as I am concerned.', '2005-11-18 06:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879434, 256497, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool paint job on the lens, how does one get one of those :P  Anyway, think it´s missing something, like the head of the photographer and he/she was also painted in camouflage colours in the face or something but it works nicely like it is, you got a 6 from me.</td>', 'Cool paint job on the lens, how does one get one of those :P  Anyway, think it´s missing something, like the head of the photographer and he/she was also painted in camouflage colours in the face or something but it works nicely like it is, you got a 6 from me.', '2005-11-18 06:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879435, 256450, 47918, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the camouflage here?</td>', 'I don''t see the camouflage here?', '2005-11-18 06:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879436, 257591, 27482, '<td valign="top">Cool, really love the DOF, this must have been shot with a monster of a lens.  8 from me.</td>', 'Cool, really love the DOF, this must have been shot with a monster of a lens.  8 from me.', '2005-11-18 06:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1879437, 258231, 33535, '<td valign="top">hehe really creative entry my favorite until now<br/>couldn''t find any criticism only sitting infront of that pic and :)<br/>(skalvert? -if not take it as a compliment ;P )</td>', 'hehe really creative entry my favorite until nowcouldn''t find any criticism only sitting infront of that pic and :)(skalvert? -if not take it as a compliment ;P )', '2005-11-18 06:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
