(1879800, 258128, 27440, '<td valign="top">Very tempting  eyes. Though remember if you show a face of a human or an animal.... the eyes can never be out of focus!  We are predators and that''s where eventually we''ll look. It''s a bad thing especially on a shot like this to have eyes out of focus. This doesn''t work for this picture. It''s not helping.<br/> <br/>I like the idea and I assume that next time you will keep the eyes in sharp focus. So I give you a 9 :)</td>', 'Very tempting  eyes. Though remember if you show a face of a human or an animal.... the eyes can never be out of focus!  We are predators and that''s where eventually we''ll look. It''s a bad thing especially on a shot like this to have eyes out of focus. This doesn''t work for this picture. It''s not helping. I like the idea and I assume that next time you will keep the eyes in sharp focus. So I give you a 9 :)', '2005-11-18 10:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
