(1882867, 258231, 44743, '<td valign="top">Very nice / original concept.  Nicely implemented.  The painted knuckles was  a great touch.</td>', 'Very nice / original concept.  Nicely implemented.  The painted knuckles was  a great touch.', '2005-11-19 13:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882871, 258170, 44743, '<td valign="top">Great title!</td>', 'Great title!', '2005-11-19 13:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882875, 258179, 44743, '<td valign="top">hehe... fun shot.  Took me a little bit to find the hidden lens.</td>', 'hehe... fun shot.  Took me a little bit to find the hidden lens.', '2005-11-19 13:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882878, 257146, 44743, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot!  Fun / original idea.  Though I''m feeling rather hungry now, I''ve not been able to find the Skittle.</td>', 'This is a great shot!  Fun / original idea.  Though I''m feeling rather hungry now, I''ve not been able to find the Skittle.', '2005-11-19 13:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882895, 256254, 44743, '<td valign="top">I guess there''s a woodpecker there, but I can''t find it.  Guess that makes for good camouflage?</td>', 'I guess there''s a woodpecker there, but I can''t find it.  Guess that makes for good camouflage?', '2005-11-19 13:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882908, 257549, 44743, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Great idea.  Perfect color match.</td>', 'Love it!  Great idea.  Perfect color match.', '2005-11-19 14:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882965, 258131, 42714, '<td valign="top">That''s a pretty good idea.  My opinion about the DOF is because of the fine nature of the camoflauged objects, the entire composition in this ''aerial'' should be sharp.  However, I could easily see such a depth of field if the photo had a more dramatic perspective.  Also love the composition of the actual objects themselves.</td>', 'That''s a pretty good idea.  My opinion about the DOF is because of the fine nature of the camoflauged objects, the entire composition in this ''aerial'' should be sharp.  However, I could easily see such a depth of field if the photo had a more dramatic perspective.  Also love the composition of the actual objects themselves.', '2005-11-19 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882971, 258191, 42714, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to make a comment on the border - I realize this is in keeping with the scheme of your photograph, but because of the boldness and brightness of the border it is competing with the photograph itself by attracting as much attention to the viewer''s eye.  The composition of the actual photo is to be commended, but is suffering by some hot spots and deep shadow in the right hand corner.</td>', 'Just wanted to make a comment on the border - I realize this is in keeping with the scheme of your photograph, but because of the boldness and brightness of the border it is competing with the photograph itself by attracting as much attention to the viewer''s eye.  The composition of the actual photo is to be commended, but is suffering by some hot spots and deep shadow in the right hand corner.', '2005-11-19 14:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882976, 257676, 42714, '<td valign="top">Looks like some good old fashion glass and/or mirror play.  Nice understated composition, it conveys a lot of emotion.</td>', 'Looks like some good old fashion glass and/or mirror play.  Nice understated composition, it conveys a lot of emotion.', '2005-11-19 14:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882984, 257657, 42714, '<td valign="top">First good idea, but I think the execution is lacking.  Technically, the entire photo is just lacking in the detail necessary to really pull the photo off, you''re dealing with very detailed objects.  Compositionally, it may be a bit too difficult to find that Canadian piece near the top.  Maybe placing the photo closer to the center (but not necessarily at) the center would help.  Another idea to add variety is perhaps to add some more ''tails''.  Play with it. :)</td>', 'First good idea, but I think the execution is lacking.  Technically, the entire photo is just lacking in the detail necessary to really pull the photo off, you''re dealing with very detailed objects.  Compositionally, it may be a bit too difficult to find that Canadian piece near the top.  Maybe placing the photo closer to the center (but not necessarily at) the center would help.  Another idea to add variety is perhaps to add some more ''tails''.  Play with it. :)', '2005-11-19 14:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1882988, 258230, 42714, '<td valign="top">Compositionally, I''d advise to crop the bottom of the photograph, because of it''s prominence of the top of the vehicle, particularly in relation to the sign, your eye is naturally drawn to that instead of any camoflauged background.</td>', 'Compositionally, I''d advise to crop the bottom of the photograph, because of it''s prominence of the top of the vehicle, particularly in relation to the sign, your eye is naturally drawn to that instead of any camoflauged background.', '2005-11-19 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883010, 258198, 42714, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo compositionally, that unfortunately is lacking in the focus department.  If you''re not working with an SLR, it''s likely that your camera is center-focused.  My recommendation would be to center your entire camera on so at least the head of the lizard so that is in focus, then crop your photograph to keep the same proportions you have now.</td>', 'This is a good photo compositionally, that unfortunately is lacking in the focus department.  If you''re not working with an SLR, it''s likely that your camera is center-focused.  My recommendation would be to center your entire camera on so at least the head of the lizard so that is in focus, then crop your photograph to keep the same proportions you have now.', '2005-11-19 14:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883019, 258044, 42714, '<td valign="top">Great photograph and I love your understanding of framing, using just horizontal elements.  Kudos.</td>', 'Great photograph and I love your understanding of framing, using just horizontal elements.  Kudos.', '2005-11-19 15:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883029, 257591, 42714, '<td valign="top">What I appreciate about this is how the antlers and trees mimic each other in form.  I''m about 3/4 through this thing and it''s the best above-water wildlife photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge.</td>', 'What I appreciate about this is how the antlers and trees mimic each other in form.  I''m about 3/4 through this thing and it''s the best above-water wildlife photo I''ve seen so far in this challenge.', '2005-11-19 15:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883032, 258083, 42714, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen a bunch of these photos, but they''re typically in bad focus, poorly lit, and/or poor composition.  This is the only time I''ve seen it successfully executed in all three regards.  Kudos, love the use of color as well.</td>', 'I''ve seen a bunch of these photos, but they''re typically in bad focus, poorly lit, and/or poor composition.  This is the only time I''ve seen it successfully executed in all three regards.  Kudos, love the use of color as well.', '2005-11-19 15:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883035, 258151, 42714, '<td valign="top">No critical comment, but just wanted to say this was pretty cute.</td>', 'No critical comment, but just wanted to say this was pretty cute.', '2005-11-19 15:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883057, 257302, 24013, '<td valign="top">fascinating!  nicely captured little patterns on the bug.</td>', 'fascinating!  nicely captured little patterns on the bug.', '2005-11-19 15:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
