(1883224, 258255, 43031, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo, even though I''m not real sure about the weight of the camo here. it''s a hard balance to show the camo without showing too much, but I think those very sharp eyes make this great.</td>', 'i really like this photo, even though I''m not real sure about the weight of the camo here. it''s a hard balance to show the camo without showing too much, but I think those very sharp eyes make this great.', '2005-11-19 17:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883226, 257549, 22379, '<td valign="top">She really does match well doesn''t see. The concept is great, but the image isn''t quite popping. I don''t know what would make it pop though.</td>', 'She really does match well doesn''t see. The concept is great, but the image isn''t quite popping. I don''t know what would make it pop though.', '2005-11-19 17:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883228, 258158, 43031, '<td valign="top">this is one of myfavorites in the whole challenge, I don''t imagine I would have seen him sitting in those lieave. :) The vibrant colors in this are the strong point I think, having a bit more yellow would have been great. I think possibly a different crop could have done wonders also. but I still really like this.</td>', 'this is one of myfavorites in the whole challenge, I don''t imagine I would have seen him sitting in those lieave. :) The vibrant colors in this are the strong point I think, having a bit more yellow would have been great. I think possibly a different crop could have done wonders also. but I still really like this.', '2005-11-19 17:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1883233, 256819, 43031, '<td valign="top">perfect camo entry, if this doesn''t fit, nothing does. great placement of the spider, possibly could have done with a deeper DOF, and more charpening.</td>', 'perfect camo entry, if this doesn''t fit, nothing does. great placement of the spider, possibly could have done with a deeper DOF, and more charpening.', '2005-11-19 17:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
