(1885698, 257844, 30881, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Like the touch of humour and the facial expression Good rule of thirds. "8"</td>', 'Great idea! Like the touch of humour and the facial expression Good rule of thirds. "8"', '2005-11-20 22:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885719, 258058, 30881, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t care for grey b''kgrounds but in this case it works great. Sets a great tone for the whithering leaves. Nice touch of humour too. Maybe just a bit sharper on the peels?</td>', 'Normally I don''t care for grey b''kgrounds but in this case it works great. Sets a great tone for the whithering leaves. Nice touch of humour too. Maybe just a bit sharper on the peels?', '2005-11-20 22:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885732, 256781, 30881, '<td valign="top">A nice touch of humour. Like the solid white backgroundWould have liked to see the "Coca Cola" stay a solid white on all the cans. Overall an very good image</td>', 'A nice touch of humour. Like the solid white backgroundWould have liked to see the "Coca Cola" stay a solid white on all the cans. Overall an very good image', '2005-11-20 22:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885740, 258077, 30881, '<td valign="top">Very cute. Wish the mane on front zebra was just a bit sharper. Good work.</td>', 'Very cute. Wish the mane on front zebra was just a bit sharper. Good work.', '2005-11-20 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885759, 258123, 30881, '<td valign="top">I think in this case all the additional blurring helps you main subject. Also like the pastel colors. Nice capture. Good Luck</td>', 'I think in this case all the additional blurring helps you main subject. Also like the pastel colors. Nice capture. Good Luck', '2005-11-20 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885767, 257852, 30881, '<td valign="top">Good imaginitive shot Nice to see theres no bright light reflection from all that white. Good shot!!</td>', 'Good imaginitive shot Nice to see theres no bright light reflection from all that white. Good shot!!', '2005-11-20 22:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885770, 257674, 30881, '<td valign="top">Certainly fires up the imagination. Nice image. Light ray in the trees is a nice capture. Good Job!</td>', 'Certainly fires up the imagination. Nice image. Light ray in the trees is a nice capture. Good Job!', '2005-11-20 22:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885773, 256691, 30881, '<td valign="top">Normally I would consider all those branches far too distracting, but because of this challenge I think it works great as camoflage. Nice blurred background Colors all work excellent together Good Luck "8"</td>', 'Normally I would consider all those branches far too distracting, but because of this challenge I think it works great as camoflage. Nice blurred background Colors all work excellent together Good Luck "8"', '2005-11-20 22:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885789, 257834, 30881, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful capture. Don''t care for the high lighting in upper left side of photo. Otherwise I think this is very good. Nice shot.</td>', 'What a wonderful capture. Don''t care for the high lighting in upper left side of photo. Otherwise I think this is very good. Nice shot.', '2005-11-20 23:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1885887, 257951, 40344, '<td valign="top">You''re to be congratulated your shot of the owl is lovely.</td>', 'You''re to be congratulated your shot of the owl is lovely.', '2005-11-20 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886296, 257841, 36371, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!!!</td>', 'Gorgeous!!!', '2005-11-21 01:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886302, 257146, 36371, '<td valign="top">Should have just named this ''''Hiding...." Great photo.</td>', 'Should have just named this ''''Hiding...." Great photo.', '2005-11-21 01:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886309, 258246, 36371, '<td valign="top">The lips look different enough...the teeth are a distraction. Good thought tho.</td>', 'The lips look different enough...the teeth are a distraction. Good thought tho.', '2005-11-21 01:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886316, 258246, 12448, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this shot.  You almost had me the first time around, which is a very good thing, that''s the idea behind camouflage, making one look twice to see if they saw what they think they saw, LOL!   Was that as clear as mud? :)<br/> <br/>I love this and if the hole was just a touch bigger and the lips were closed like the rest of them this would be a perfect camouflage.  So one point off for that. :)  Next, the light is just a bit blown out on the left side and middle which can work for this since it helps bring out the defining lines on the lips but the lack of light on the right make the lips look a bit blobby, if the light was more evenly distributed this would have been a 10, as it is, a 9</td>', 'I keep coming back to this shot.  You almost had me the first time around, which is a very good thing, that''s the idea behind camouflage, making one look twice to see if they saw what they think they saw, LOL!   Was that as clear as mud? :) I love this and if the hole was just a touch bigger and the lips were closed like the rest of them this would be a perfect camouflage.  So one point off for that. :)  Next, the light is just a bit blown out on the left side and middle which can work for this since it helps bring out the defining lines on the lips but the lack of light on the right make the lips look a bit blobby, if the light was more evenly distributed this would have been a 10, as it is, a 9', '2005-11-21 01:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886320, 257959, 12448, '<td valign="top">Dang!  ALL THESE BUGS!!!! :)  This is amazing!  Absolutely amazing!  I have nothing to complain about here, this is just simply perfect.  My first 10</td>', 'Dang!  ALL THESE BUGS!!!! :)  This is amazing!  Absolutely amazing!  I have nothing to complain about here, this is just simply perfect.  My first 10', '2005-11-21 01:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1886328, 257733, 12448, '<td valign="top">OMG!  ROFLMAO!!! This is wonderful!  Absolutely wonderful!  Except for the tiny misalignments this is a perfect as it gets.  I''m giving you a 10 for effort and creativity and uniqueness! :)</td>', 'OMG!  ROFLMAO!!! This is wonderful!  Absolutely wonderful!  Except for the tiny misalignments this is a perfect as it gets.  I''m giving you a 10 for effort and creativity and uniqueness! :)', '2005-11-21 01:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
