(1886554, 258166, 45927, '<td valign="top">The shadows do make the birds seem like they''re part of other things, but maybe this picture could''ve been cropped better. There''s just too much background for my taste.</td>', 'The shadows do make the birds seem like they''re part of other things, but maybe this picture could''ve been cropped better. There''s just too much background for my taste.', '2005-11-21 03:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
