(1887541, 256311, 39850, '<td valign="top">7 - Excellent capture.  Criticism; especially for the Challenge, would like to have seen just a little more context/environment.  If the nose were as sharp as the eyes/ears make this even better in my opinion, but I doubt you had much time.  The fore ''bokeh''(?) type effect is very nice and soft and adds to the shot.  Colors are nice.  Not sure on the frame, works - especially to enhance the camouflage, but not sure it enhances the reindeer(?) as best as another color may have.  Maybe slightly more space to the right, not sure.</td>', '7 - Excellent capture.  Criticism; especially for the Challenge, would like to have seen just a little more context/environment.  If the nose were as sharp as the eyes/ears make this even better in my opinion, but I doubt you had much time.  The fore ''bokeh''(?) type effect is very nice and soft and adds to the shot.  Colors are nice.  Not sure on the frame, works - especially to enhance the camouflage, but not sure it enhances the reindeer(?) as best as another color may have.  Maybe slightly more space to the right, not sure.', '2005-11-21 16:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
