(1888866, 258169, 47597, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of fall-off of light further into the room and at the rear of the cat. The cat would be more interesting if he was looking at the camera, or doing something interesting. Sharper focus needed too.</td>', 'There''s a lot of fall-off of light further into the room and at the rear of the cat. The cat would be more interesting if he was looking at the camera, or doing something interesting. Sharper focus needed too.', '2005-11-22 05:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
