(1888869, 258174, 47597, '<td valign="top">The silhouette of the bird is lovely, and the cloud/sky is pretty. But the smaller object (plane?) is too small to make out. I find it a distraction, rather than a point of interest. I like the darker areas around the edge of the sky which almost frame the subject.</td>', 'The silhouette of the bird is lovely, and the cloud/sky is pretty. But the smaller object (plane?) is too small to make out. I find it a distraction, rather than a point of interest. I like the darker areas around the edge of the sky which almost frame the subject.', '2005-11-22 05:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888872, 256888, 47597, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped a bit more off the right. The browns and greens are quite rich.</td>', 'I would have cropped a bit more off the right. The browns and greens are quite rich.', '2005-11-22 05:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888873, 258251, 47597, '<td valign="top">Pretty. I find the light background distracting me away from th butterfly. Good closeup otherwise.</td>', 'Pretty. I find the light background distracting me away from th butterfly. Good closeup otherwise.', '2005-11-22 05:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888875, 256691, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like the DoF, and the diagonal branches make a good composition. Good shot.</td>', 'I like the DoF, and the diagonal branches make a good composition. Good shot.', '2005-11-22 05:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888876, 258198, 47597, '<td valign="top">It seems out of focus to me - I can''t really make out the lizard. The red flower on the right also distracts me because it stands out of the background. I would have cropped the right more.</td>', 'It seems out of focus to me - I can''t really make out the lizard. The red flower on the right also distracts me because it stands out of the background. I would have cropped the right more.', '2005-11-22 05:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888880, 257608, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like the soft shadows on the right, but the shadow on her shoulder is too crisp (is it your hand?). But my eye is immediately drawn to her eye - nice. Her face looks overexposed.</td>', 'I like the soft shadows on the right, but the shadow on her shoulder is too crisp (is it your hand?). But my eye is immediately drawn to her eye - nice. Her face looks overexposed.', '2005-11-22 05:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888881, 258262, 47597, '<td valign="top">Quite pretty. I like that the insect seems lit while the lily is in shadow at that spot. The lily seems a bit dull though.</td>', 'Quite pretty. I like that the insect seems lit while the lily is in shadow at that spot. The lily seems a bit dull though.', '2005-11-22 05:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888883, 258009, 47597, '<td valign="top">The colours seem quite washed out - more contrast. The white thing (pipe?) on the right distracts me also.</td>', 'The colours seem quite washed out - more contrast. The white thing (pipe?) on the right distracts me also.', '2005-11-22 05:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888884, 256348, 47597, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. My favourite so far. I love how you can even see a reflection in the baby''s eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful. My favourite so far. I love how you can even see a reflection in the baby''s eyes.', '2005-11-22 05:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888885, 256172, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like the oranges and browns and dappled lighting.</td>', 'I like the oranges and browns and dappled lighting.', '2005-11-22 05:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888886, 258149, 47597, '<td valign="top">The squirrel is too small to make it interesting. The pic doesn''t grab me.</td>', 'The squirrel is too small to make it interesting. The pic doesn''t grab me.', '2005-11-22 05:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888887, 258142, 47597, '<td valign="top">I like it. It interests me.</td>', 'I like it. It interests me.', '2005-11-22 05:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888888, 256781, 47597, '<td valign="top">Rich red and white colours make it bold. I''d prefer that the cans further back were in better focus.</td>', 'Rich red and white colours make it bold. I''d prefer that the cans further back were in better focus.', '2005-11-22 05:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888907, 258058, 43346, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to spot this. Very good!</td>', 'It took me a while to spot this. Very good!', '2005-11-22 06:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888915, 257853, 47904, '<td valign="top">very pretty pic but what does it have to do with camouflage?</td>', 'very pretty pic but what does it have to do with camouflage?', '2005-11-22 06:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888938, 256772, 47904, '<td valign="top">this is the exact creature i thaought about when i first saw the challange!<br/>what a great camouflage!</td>', 'this is the exact creature i thaought about when i first saw the challange!what a great camouflage!', '2005-11-22 07:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888956, 257640, 10047, '<td valign="top">Cute, but a little soft. Might have put a bedsheet over the couch before arranging the props.</td>', 'Cute, but a little soft. Might have put a bedsheet over the couch before arranging the props.', '2005-11-22 07:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888957, 256083, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft and dark, but definitely meets the challenge.</td>', 'A little soft and dark, but definitely meets the challenge.', '2005-11-22 07:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888959, 257841, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent color and composition. Not too sure about the camo unless the butterfly is really well hidden.</td>', 'Excellent color and composition. Not too sure about the camo unless the butterfly is really well hidden.', '2005-11-22 07:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888961, 258259, 10047, '<td valign="top">Too centered and close. Might have backed off a little, cropped to the left, and used the b&amp;w shadows to make the model blend in more.</td>', 'Too centered and close. Might have backed off a little, cropped to the left, and used the b&w shadows to make the model blend in more.', '2005-11-22 07:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888963, 256728, 10047, '<td valign="top">Might have straightened out the line formed by the water surface, or shot from a slightly higher angle to take it out of the frame. Nice detail on the eye.</td>', 'Might have straightened out the line formed by the water surface, or shot from a slightly higher angle to take it out of the frame. Nice detail on the eye.', '2005-11-22 07:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888964, 258009, 10047, '<td valign="top">I might have cropped further left to get rid of the white pipe on the right side.</td>', 'I might have cropped further left to get rid of the white pipe on the right side.', '2005-11-22 07:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888965, 257302, 38032, '<td valign="top">perfect for cam -- this should ribbon imo 9</td>', 'perfect for cam -- this should ribbon imo 9', '2005-11-22 08:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888966, 256689, 38032, '<td valign="top">cool dof  - scary 7</td>', 'cool dof  - scary 7', '2005-11-22 08:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888967, 258198, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice arrangement, but a little soft. Might have cropped a little more off the left to get rid of the parallel lines in the background.</td>', 'Nice arrangement, but a little soft. Might have cropped a little more off the left to get rid of the parallel lines in the background.', '2005-11-22 08:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888968, 257555, 10047, '<td valign="top">I mght have backed off this one a bit to give the bug room to hide in the frame.</td>', 'I mght have backed off this one a bit to give the bug room to hide in the frame.', '2005-11-22 08:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888971, 256303, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and excellent earth tones. I might have zoomed out on this one to include the whole butterfly, but maybe that wasn''t a possibility.</td>', 'Nice macro and excellent earth tones. I might have zoomed out on this one to include the whole butterfly, but maybe that wasn''t a possibility.', '2005-11-22 08:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888972, 257718, 10047, '<td valign="top">I think I would have cropped to the right and excluded the left deer, and also straightened the photo..</td>', 'I think I would have cropped to the right and excluded the left deer, and also straightened the photo..', '2005-11-22 08:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888975, 256843, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Wonder if it would have been more dramatic to move some leaves to get light on the eyes.</td>', 'Nicely done. Wonder if it would have been more dramatic to move some leaves to get light on the eyes.', '2005-11-22 08:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888984, 256689, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. Perhaps too centered, but still well done.</td>', 'Nice macro. Perhaps too centered, but still well done.', '2005-11-22 08:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888989, 256329, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft and too centered. Too bad he wouldn''t move up into the darker foliage for you.</td>', 'A little soft and too centered. Too bad he wouldn''t move up into the darker foliage for you.', '2005-11-22 08:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888990, 256686, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Excellent composition. I wonder what the effect would have been to switch to MF, get the face in focus and the leaves blurred.</td>', 'Nicely done. Excellent composition. I wonder what the effect would have been to switch to MF, get the face in focus and the leaves blurred.', '2005-11-22 08:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888993, 258213, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Nice capture. I might have tried darkening, just to see the different effects and blending.</td>', 'Excellent. Nice capture. I might have tried darkening, just to see the different effects and blending.', '2005-11-22 08:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888994, 255907, 10047, '<td valign="top">A little soft around the head, but nice use of angle and natural colors.</td>', 'A little soft around the head, but nice use of angle and natural colors.', '2005-11-22 08:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1888998, 257591, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Excellent DOF and the muted background. Might have cropped just little more left.</td>', 'Nicely done. Excellent DOF and the muted background. Might have cropped just little more left.', '2005-11-22 08:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889000, 258179, 10047, '<td valign="top">WOW! I have that lens and that scotch cylinder. Thanks for the excellent idea. I might have cropped off the very left of the cylinder and had more room on the right.</td>', 'WOW! I have that lens and that scotch cylinder. Thanks for the excellent idea. I might have cropped off the very left of the cylinder and had more room on the right.', '2005-11-22 08:28:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889001, 256772, 26633, '<td valign="top">The best natural history shot in the challenge. The lighting is superb, the sharpness and focus are there, the composition is spot on and there is plenty of information. 10</td>', 'The best natural history shot in the challenge. The lighting is superb, the sharpness and focus are there, the composition is spot on and there is plenty of information. 10', '2005-11-22 08:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889006, 257478, 26633, '<td valign="top">The best non-natural shot in the challenge for me. Eerie, mysterious, brooding, take your pick! It looks like the mysterious figure could just blend into the wall or the fog or leap out at us. That sense of unease it what makes this work for me. 10</td>', 'The best non-natural shot in the challenge for me. Eerie, mysterious, brooding, take your pick! It looks like the mysterious figure could just blend into the wall or the fog or leap out at us. That sense of unease it what makes this work for me. 10', '2005-11-22 08:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889007, 258085, 26633, '<td valign="top">Cleverly thought out and well executed. 9 from me but you know it will bomb ;)</td>', 'Cleverly thought out and well executed. 9 from me but you know it will bomb ;)', '2005-11-22 08:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889008, 257676, 10047, '<td valign="top">Masking the thoughts about returning? Exceptional. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Masking the thoughts about returning? Exceptional. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-11-22 08:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889009, 257959, 10047, '<td valign="top">Exceptional! One of my favorites for this challenge. Hope it ribbons.</td>', 'Exceptional! One of my favorites for this challenge. Hope it ribbons.', '2005-11-22 08:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889011, 257583, 26633, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well done. The digital "grain" works and so does the tone. 9</td>', 'Clever idea and well done. The digital "grain" works and so does the tone. 9', '2005-11-22 08:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889012, 258255, 10047, '<td valign="top">The cloak of darkness. Excellent. I might have tried sharpening the eyes.</td>', 'The cloak of darkness. Excellent. I might have tried sharpening the eyes.', '2005-11-22 08:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889014, 257591, 26633, '<td valign="top">I would prefer this one without the tree trunks but nevertheless it works really well. Great colours, the soft lighting helps a lot and the low viewpoint connects us so well with the stag. 9.</td>', 'I would prefer this one without the tree trunks but nevertheless it works really well. Great colours, the soft lighting helps a lot and the low viewpoint connects us so well with the stag. 9.', '2005-11-22 08:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889015, 256422, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nice little rack so early in the season. I might have cropped off his hind quarters to get rid of the white flag.</td>', 'Nice little rack so early in the season. I might have cropped off his hind quarters to get rid of the white flag.', '2005-11-22 08:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889017, 258234, 26633, '<td valign="top">Cute! Well composed and lit. The crop adds enough mystery, the complementary patterns and the monochrome treatment work well. 9</td>', 'Cute! Well composed and lit. The crop adds enough mystery, the complementary patterns and the monochrome treatment work well. 9', '2005-11-22 08:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889020, 255878, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. I''m tempted to download it and rotate it to see the effect of being right side up.</td>', 'Excellent. I''m tempted to download it and rotate it to see the effect of being right side up.', '2005-11-22 08:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889021, 258213, 26633, '<td valign="top">Scary! Well composed, well lit, good colours. Better be an 8</td>', 'Scary! Well composed, well lit, good colours. Better be an 8', '2005-11-22 08:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889023, 257302, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Mother Nature with some of her best camo. I think I might have experimented with a wider frame.</td>', 'Excellent. Mother Nature with some of her best camo. I think I might have experimented with a wider frame.', '2005-11-22 08:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889026, 257740, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Not sure if the fence helps or hurts. I would have experimented with different bacgrounds, but maybe you did.</td>', 'Well done. Not sure if the fence helps or hurts. I would have experimented with different bacgrounds, but maybe you did.', '2005-11-22 08:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889030, 258232, 10047, '<td valign="top">Think I would have gone with a landscape crop, but not sure what you had to work with. Looks like my garden and rabbit.</td>', 'Think I would have gone with a landscape crop, but not sure what you had to work with. Looks like my garden and rabbit.', '2005-11-22 08:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889033, 257814, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Would like to see him with some medium and dark green camo paint on his face.</td>', 'Well done. Would like to see him with some medium and dark green camo paint on his face.', '2005-11-22 08:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889036, 255972, 10047, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Might have gone with a more rectangular crop and taken out the right most branch.</td>', 'Excellent. Might have gone with a more rectangular crop and taken out the right most branch.', '2005-11-22 08:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889039, 257146, 47597, '<td valign="top">Pic seems a little grainy and could be sharper. There is a distracting edge that could have been cropped on the right hand side.</td>', 'Pic seems a little grainy and could be sharper. There is a distracting edge that could have been cropped on the right hand side.', '2005-11-22 08:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889040, 257567, 10047, '<td valign="top">Well done. Would like to see it with some face paint.</td>', 'Well done. Would like to see it with some face paint.', '2005-11-22 08:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889042, 257663, 10047, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Had to hunt for the moth.</td>', 'Nicely done. Had to hunt for the moth.', '2005-11-22 08:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889044, 257478, 47597, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric and evocative. I like the wet road reflection in the foreground. It contrasts nicely with the gloomy dark.</td>', 'Atmospheric and evocative. I like the wet road reflection in the foreground. It contrasts nicely with the gloomy dark.', '2005-11-22 08:48:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889046, 256253, 10047, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I might have sharpened the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful. I might have sharpened the eye.', '2005-11-22 08:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889047, 258063, 47597, '<td valign="top">Exquisite! That eye looks so sinister! Good dof. Perhaps the out-of-focus foreground object takes up too much of the composition though.</td>', 'Exquisite! That eye looks so sinister! Good dof. Perhaps the out-of-focus foreground object takes up too much of the composition though.', '2005-11-22 08:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1889052, 257852, 47597, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the topic, but there is no photographic technique that stands out for me and makes the pic memorable.</td>', 'Good idea for the topic, but there is no photographic technique that stands out for me and makes the pic memorable.', '2005-11-22 08:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
