(1889073, 258155, 47597, '<td valign="top">I would have suggested cropping the people on the right, but I guess they''re there to show the context of the pic (ie: festival). Nice effect.</td>', 'I would have suggested cropping the people on the right, but I guess they''re there to show the context of the pic (ie: festival). Nice effect.', '2005-11-22 09:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
