(1890491, 258029, 22734, '<td valign="top">"Excuse me while I touch the sky."  This is an image that is rather timeless in its message. It is fanciful and whimsical yet it conveys a deeper meaning. I try very hard to find the purpose whether open or hidden. Here I must confess I am at a loss to the concept of camouflage.  Yet the image entertains my fancy and I feel i may be missing something. Regardless, I will bump to to 7 on its visual qualities.</td>', '"Excuse me while I touch the sky."  This is an image that is rather timeless in its message. It is fanciful and whimsical yet it conveys a deeper meaning. I try very hard to find the purpose whether open or hidden. Here I must confess I am at a loss to the concept of camouflage.  Yet the image entertains my fancy and I feel i may be missing something. Regardless, I will bump to to 7 on its visual qualities.', '2005-11-22 21:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
