(1891096, 258124, 29011, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes :)<br/> <br/>This was sort of like a lightbulb went on idea, but spur of the moment.<br/>Shot just a few hours before the challenge deadline. A few things  I would''ve liked to do better, get enough DOF so the stem appeared even sharper enough but still keep the tangerines behind in an OOF state.  I would think their imperfections would be more of a hinder and since spot editing is not allowed you get my point ;) same goes with the blown highlight of the light reflecting off one of the tangerines. My hands where just itching to clone that out. Use of a different light source would''ve been better but not handy at the moment. Also.. yes the bit of green visible was left there on purpose. I would really like to reshoot this image with some of the suggestions put into place. This was a really fun challenge. Thanks again, everyone.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-11-23 01:06:21.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes :) This was sort of like a lightbulb went on idea, but spur of the moment.Shot just a few hours before the challenge deadline. A few things  I would''ve liked to do better, get enough DOF so the stem appeared even sharper enough but still keep the tangerines behind in an OOF state.  I would think their imperfections would be more of a hinder and since spot editing is not allowed you get my point ;) same goes with the blown highlight of the light reflecting off one of the tangerines. My hands where just itching to clone that out. Use of a different light source would''ve been better but not handy at the moment. Also.. yes the bit of green visible was left there on purpose. I would really like to reshoot this image with some of the suggestions put into place. This was a really fun challenge. Thanks again, everyone.', '2005-11-23 00:27:06.000000', '2005-11-23 01:06:21.000000', 0),
(1891132, 258109, 46094, '<td valign="top">Very nice, detailed picture.  Impressive!  Me gusta!</td>', 'Very nice, detailed picture.  Impressive!  Me gusta!', '2005-11-23 00:34:46.000000', NULL, 0),
