(1892329, 257612, 32767, '<td valign="top">It does look like both the cat and the sheets are slightly soft, in focus but what voters here tend to gravitate towards, in negative terms are "blown highlights". It looks like this is slighly overexposed but white subjects are really tough to nail down. +/- exposure controls could help out, towards the negative numbers. Hope that helps.</td>', 'It does look like both the cat and the sheets are slightly soft, in focus but what voters here tend to gravitate towards, in negative terms are "blown highlights". It looks like this is slighly overexposed but white subjects are really tough to nail down. +/- exposure controls could help out, towards the negative numbers. Hope that helps.', '2005-11-23 11:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
